===== Back to OEM / stock firmware =====

  - find the latest OEM Firmware Upgrade, e.g.: ''fw-7620-WiFiDGRJ-RAVPower-RP-WD03-2.000.074''
  - unpack the payload and the ext2 filesystem with some [[https://github.com/cryptographrix/HooToo_HT-TM05-hacking/network|tools]]
  - find the ''kernel'' and ''rootfs''
  - use the files for TFTP recovery
  - if you had back up your device: [[https://forum.openwrt.org/t/procedure-for-going-back-to-oem-firmware-for-rp-wd03/20261/5]]

